  "Specification": "Voucher issuance transaction protocol (VTP). Models a voucher holder (H), issuer (I), and voucher (V) coordinating through prepared/issue/abort messages. A voucher transitions from phantom to valid upon successful issuance. Proves type safety, consistency (no holder holding while issuer aborted or vice versa), and refinement of the VoucherLifeCycle specification.",
